STEP 3: Deployment config
-------------------------
capstone/deploy/ as Kustomize (base + overlays/dev + overlays/prod) or
a Helm chart with values-dev/values-prod. Include:
  Namespace, Deployments (frontend, api), StatefulSet (db), Services,
  Ingress with cert-manager annotation (issuer lab-ca), ConfigMap,
  HPA (api), PDBs, NetworkPolicies, ServiceMonitor (if your API
  exposes /metrics; add prometheus-flask-exporter, or monitor the
  ingress controller), PrometheusRule.
The DB password Secret: create it by hand (k create secret ...) or
with Sealed Secrets; never plain in Git.


